---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
interface Props {lang:"en"|"pt-br";}
const {lang}=Astro.props;
const pt=lang==="pt-br",prefix=pt?"/pt-br":"";
---
<BaseLayout lang={lang}
 title={(pt?"Pesquisa de preços do Market":"Market price research")+" | Atlantica Knowledge Hub"}
 alternatePaths={{en:"/tools/market-prices/","pt-br":"/pt-br/tools/market-prices/"}}>
 <main class="mpr-page" id="mpr-root" data-lang={lang}>
  <nav><a href={prefix+"/tools/"}>{pt?"← Ferramentas":"← Tools"}</a></nav>
  <p class="mpr-eyebrow">ATLANTICA GLOBAL / NA · CLIENT EVIDENCE</p>
  <h1>{pt?"Pesquisa de preços do Market":"Market price research"}</h1>
  <p class="mpr-intro">{pt
   ?"Revise os 128 itens do catálogo geral NPC que não estavam entre os 293 ItemIDs conciliados com a referência histórica de 2025. Os preços exibidos vêm do cliente e NÃO comprovam ofertas fixas no Market atual."
   :"Review the 128 NPC general-catalog items outside the 293 ItemIDs matched against the 2025 historical reference. Shown prices come from the client and do NOT prove current fixed-price Market listings."}</p>
  <p class="mpr-disclaimer">{pt
   ?"As observações são relatos inseridos por você e ficam somente neste navegador. Não viram preços oficiais da Wiki nem são enviadas automaticamente."
   :"Observations are your own reports stored only in this browser. They never become official Wiki prices or get uploaded automatically."}</p>
  <section class="mpr-panel">
   <h2>{pt?"Confirmação relatada por jogador":"Player-reported confirmation"}</h2>
   <p class="mpr-description" id="mpr-player-report-status" role="status">{pt?"Carregando registro da confirmação…":"Loading confirmation record…"}</p>
   <p class="mpr-description">{pt
    ?"Em 23/11/2026, o jogador responsável pela conferência informou que todos os 128 preços pendentes correspondiam aos exibidos no Market. É um relato consolidado, não 128 capturas individuais nem uma auditoria independente. Os valores originais do cliente permanecem inalterados."
    :"On November 23, 2026, the reviewing player reported that all 128 pending prices matched the in-game Market. This is a single aggregate report, not 128 individual screenshots or an independent audit. Original client prices remain unchanged."}</p>
  </section>
  <section class="mpr-panel">
   <h2>{pt?"Candidatos para verificação":"Candidates to check"}</h2>
   <p class="mpr-description" id="mpr-stats" role="status">{pt?"Carregando candidatos…":"Loading candidates…"}</p>
   <div class="mpr-toolbar">
    <label>{pt?"Pesquisar nome ou ItemID":"Search name or ItemID"}
     <input id="mpr-search" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder={pt?"Ex.: Holly ou 2002":"e.g. Holly or 2002"}/>
    </label>
    <label>{pt?"Filtrar observações":"Filter observations"}
     <select id="mpr-filter">
      <option value="all">{pt?"Todos":"All"}</option>
      <option value="pending">{pt?"Sem observação local":"No local observation"}</option>
      <option value="reviewed">{pt?"Com observação local":"With local observation"}</option>
     </select>
    </label>
   </div>
   <div class="mpr-table-wrap" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label={pt?"Lista de candidatos":"Candidate list"}>
    <table>
     <thead><tr>
      <th>ItemID</th><th>{pt?"Nome no cliente":"Client name"}</th>
      <th>{pt?"Categoria":"Category"}</th><th>{pt?"Preço NPC (gold)":"NPC price (gold)"}</th>
      <th>{pt?"Relato do jogador":"Player report"}</th>
      <th>{pt?"Minha observação":"My observation"}</th><th>{pt?"Ação":"Action"}</th>
     </tr></thead>
     <tbody id="mpr-candidates"></tbody>
    </table>
   </div>
   <p id="mpr-visible" class="mpr-description"></p>
  </section>
  <section class="mpr-panel" id="mpr-editor" hidden>
   <h2 id="mpr-selected-title">{pt?"Registrar observação":"Record observation"}</h2>
   <p class="mpr-description" id="mpr-selected-reference"></p>
   <form id="mpr-form">
    <div class="mpr-toolbar">
     <label>{pt?"Resultado observado no jogo":"What you observed in game"}
      <select id="mpr-state" required>
       <option value="inconclusive">{pt?"Inconclusivo":"Inconclusive"}</option>
       <option value="fixed-match">{pt?"Oferta fixa com mesmo preço":"Fixed listing at client price"}</option>
       <option value="fixed-different">{pt?"Oferta fixa com preço diferente":"Fixed listing at different price"}</option>
       <option value="not-listed">{pt?"Não encontrei oferta fixa":"No fixed listing found"}</option>
      </select>
     </label>
     <label>{pt?"Preço observado (gold)":"Observed price (gold)"}
      <input id="mpr-observed-price" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]+" placeholder={pt?"Somente para ofertas observadas":"Only for observed listings"}/>
     </label>
     <label>{pt?"Data da observação":"Observation date"}
      <input id="mpr-observed-date" type="date" required/>
     </label>
    </div>
    <label class="mpr-notes-label">{pt?"Evidência / contexto (10–1000 caracteres)":"Evidence / context (10–1000 characters)"}
     <textarea id="mpr-notes" rows="3" minlength="10" maxlength="1000" required
      placeholder={pt?"Ex.: Verifiquei na janela Market, quantidade fixa e preço, servidor Global…":"e.g. Checked the in-game Market fixed listing and quantity on Global…"}></textarea>
    </label>
    <p class="mpr-description">{pt
     ?"Registre exatamente o que você viu. Uma observação local não comprova sozinha a disponibilidade permanente do item."
     :"Record exactly what you saw. A local observation alone does not prove permanent item availability."}</p>
    <div class="mpr-actions">
     <button type="submit">{pt?"Salvar observação local":"Save local observation"}</button>
     <button type="button" id="mpr-delete">{pt?"Apagar observação":"Delete observation"}</button>
     <button type="button" id="mpr-cancel">{pt?"Fechar":"Close"}</button>
    </div>
   </form>
  </section>
  <section class="mpr-panel">
   <h2>{pt?"Exportar e importar observações":"Export and import observations"}</h2>
   <p class="mpr-description">{pt
    ?"Exporte um JSON para compartilhar as evidências manualmente ou restaurar em outro navegador. Importar substitui as observações locais atuais, após confirmação."
    :"Export a JSON file to share evidence manually or restore it in another browser. Import replaces your current local observations after confirmation."}</p>
   <div class="mpr-actions">
    <button type="button" id="mpr-export">{pt?"Exportar observações JSON":"Export observations JSON"}</button>
    <label class="mpr-upload">{pt?"Importar JSON":"Import JSON"}
     <input type="file" id="mpr-import" accept=".json,application/json"/>
    </label>
   </div>
   <p id="mpr-action-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>
  <p class="mpr-description">{pt
   ?"Origem: NPCTradeItem_ENG.ndt do cliente instalado, extraído em 23/11/2026; comparação histórica Jana4U de 14/11/2025. O arquivo de servidor citado por pesquisas antigas tem o mesmo nome, mas não foi obtido do servidor Global."
   :"Sources: installed client NPCTradeItem_ENG.ndt, extracted November 23, 2026; Jana4U historical comparison dated November 14, 2025. Older technical references mention a similarly named server file, but the live Global server file was not obtained."}</p>
 </main>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
 import {REVIEW_STORAGE_KEY,parseMarketPriceReviewQueue,normalizeMarketObservation,
   validateMarketReviewBundle,buildMarketReviewBundle,parsePlayerMarketAttestation} from "../data/market-price-review.mjs";
 type Candidate={itemId:string;name:string;category:string;referenceGold:string;sourceLine:number};
 type Observation={itemId:string;state:string;observedGold:string|null;observedOn:string;notes:string};
 const root=document.getElementById("mpr-root");
 if(root){
  const pt=root.dataset.lang==="pt-br";
  const $=(id:string)=>document.getElementById(id)!;
  const results=$("mpr-candidates"),stats=$("mpr-stats"),visible=$("mpr-visible");
  const actionStatus=$("mpr-action-status");
  const editor=$("mpr-editor") as HTMLElement,form=$("mpr-form") as HTMLFormElement;
  const search=$("mpr-search") as HTMLInputElement;
  const filter=$("mpr-filter") as HTMLSelectElement;
  const state=$("mpr-state") as HTMLSelectElement;
  const price=$("mpr-observed-price") as HTMLInputElement;
  const date=$("mpr-observed-date") as HTMLInputElement;
  const notes=$("mpr-notes") as HTMLTextAreaElement;
  const importField=$("mpr-import") as HTMLInputElement;
  let candidates:Candidate[]=[];
  let byId=new Map<string,Candidate>();
  let reportedIds=new Set<string>();
  let observations=new Map<string,Observation>();
  let selectedId:string|null=null;
  const gold=(v:string)=>Number(v).toLocaleString(pt?"pt-BR":"en-US");
  const node=(tag:string,value?:string)=>{
   const el=document.createElement(tag);
   if(value!==undefined)el.textContent=value;
   return el;
  };
  const statuses:Record<string,string>=pt?{
   "fixed-match":"Oferta fixa: mesmo preço","fixed-different":"Oferta fixa: preço diferente",
   "not-listed":"Não encontrada","inconclusive":"Inconclusivo",
  }:{
   "fixed-match":"Fixed: same price","fixed-different":"Fixed: different price",
   "not-listed":"Not found","inconclusive":"Inconclusive",
  };
  function store(){
   const payload=buildMarketReviewBundle(observations,byId);
   try{localStorage.setItem(REVIEW_STORAGE_KEY,JSON.stringify(payload));return true;}
   catch{
    actionStatus.textContent=pt
     ?"Não foi possível salvar no navegador. Exporte o JSON para preservar os registros."
     :"Browser storage unavailable. Export JSON to preserve your records.";
    return false;
   }
  }
  function render(){
   const keyword=search.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase(),mode=filter.value;
   results.replaceChildren();
   const shown=candidates.filter(c=>
    (!keyword||c.name.toLocaleLowerCase().includes(keyword)||
     c.itemId.includes(keyword)||c.category.toLocaleLowerCase().includes(keyword))&&
    (mode==="all"||(mode==="reviewed")===observations.has(c.itemId)));
   for(const c of shown){
    const tr=node("tr"),record=observations.get(c.itemId);
    for(const v of [c.itemId,c.name,c.category,gold(c.referenceGold),
     reportedIds.has(c.itemId)?(pt?"Coincidente (relato)":"Match (player report)"):(pt?"Sem relato":"No report"),
     record?statuses[record.state]:(pt?"Sem observação local":"No local observation")]){
     const td=node("td",v);tr.append(td);
    }
    const td=node("td"),button=node("button",pt?"Revisar":"Review") as HTMLButtonElement;
    button.type="button";button.addEventListener("click",()=>select(c.itemId));
    td.append(button);tr.append(td);results.append(tr);
   }
   visible.textContent=(pt?"Exibindo ":"Showing ")+shown.length+
    (pt?" de 128 candidatos.":" of 128 candidates.");
   stats.textContent=observations.size+
    (pt?" / 128 com observação local · "+reportedIds.size+" relatos de coincidência (jogador)"
      :" / 128 with local observations · "+reportedIds.size+" player-reported matches");
  }
  function select(id:string){
   const c=byId.get(id);if(!c)return;
   selectedId=id;const previous=observations.get(id);
   $("mpr-selected-title").textContent=c.name+" (#"+id+")";
   $("mpr-selected-reference").textContent=(pt?"Referência NPC do cliente: ":"Client NPC reference: ")+
    gold(c.referenceGold)+" gold · "+c.category;
   state.value=previous?.state||"inconclusive";
   price.value=previous?.observedGold||"";
   date.value=previous?.observedOn||"";
   notes.value=previous?.notes||"";
   price.disabled=!state.value.startsWith("fixed-");
   editor.hidden=false;
   editor.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"});
  }
  function close(){selectedId=null;editor.hidden=true;form.reset();}
  form.addEventListener("submit",event=>{
   event.preventDefault();if(!selectedId)return;
   try{
    const record=normalizeMarketObservation({
     itemId:selectedId,state:state.value,
     observedGold:state.value.startsWith("fixed-")?price.value:null,
     observedOn:date.value,notes:notes.value,
    },byId) as Observation;
    observations.set(record.itemId,record);
    const saved=store();render();close();
    if(saved)actionStatus.textContent=pt?"Observação salva localmente.":"Observation saved locally.";
   }catch(e){
    actionStatus.textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:String(e);
   }
  });
  $("mpr-cancel").addEventListener("click",close);
  $("mpr-delete").addEventListener("click",()=>{
   if(!selectedId)return;
   observations.delete(selectedId);store();render();close();
   actionStatus.textContent=pt?"Observação apagada.":"Observation deleted.";
  });
  state.addEventListener("change",()=>{
   const hasPrice=state.value.startsWith("fixed-");
   price.disabled=!hasPrice;if(!hasPrice)price.value="";
  });
  search.addEventListener("input",render);
  filter.addEventListener("change",render);
  $("mpr-export").addEventListener("click",()=>{
   try{
    const data=buildMarketReviewBundle(observations,byId);
    const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(data,null,2)+"\n"],{type:"application/json"});
    const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=node("a") as HTMLAnchorElement;
    a.href=url;a.download="atlantica-market-observations.json";
    document.body.append(a);a.click();a.remove();
    setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);
    actionStatus.textContent=pt?"JSON exportado.":"JSON exported.";
   }catch(e){actionStatus.textContent=String(e);}
  });
  importField.addEventListener("change",async()=>{
   const file=importField.files?.[0];if(!file)return;
   try{
    if(file.size>150000)throw Error("Import exceeds 150 KB");
    const bundle=JSON.parse(await file.text());
    const incoming=validateMarketReviewBundle(bundle,byId) as Map<string,Observation>;
    const ok=window.confirm(pt
     ?"Substituir suas observações locais pelas do arquivo?"
     :"Replace your local observations with the imported file?");
    if(!ok)return;
    observations=incoming;store();render();close();
    actionStatus.textContent=pt?"Observações importadas.":"Observations imported.";
   }catch(e){
    actionStatus.textContent=(pt?"Importação recusada: ":"Import rejected: ")+
     (e instanceof Error?e.message:String(e));
   }finally{importField.value="";}
  });
  async function start(){
   try{
    const [response,attestationResponse]=await Promise.all([
     fetch("/data/client-npc-trade-prices/review-queue.json"),
     fetch("/data/client-npc-trade-prices/player-report-2026-11-23.json"),
    ]);
    if(!response.ok)throw Error("Review queue unavailable");
    candidates=parseMarketPriceReviewQueue(await response.json()) as Candidate[];
    byId=new Map(candidates.map(c=>[c.itemId,c]));
    try{
     if(!attestationResponse.ok)throw Error("Player report unavailable");
     reportedIds=parsePlayerMarketAttestation(await attestationResponse.json(),byId);
     $("mpr-player-report-status").textContent=pt
      ?"128/128 preços informados como coincidentes com o Market · fonte: relato do jogador, 23/11/2026"
      :"128/128 prices reported as matching the Market · source: player statement, Nov 23, 2026";
    }catch{
     $("mpr-player-report-status").textContent=pt
      ?"Não foi possível validar o registro do relato; os preços do cliente continuam disponíveis."
      :"Could not validate the player report; client reference prices remain available.";
    }
    try{
     const saved=localStorage.getItem(REVIEW_STORAGE_KEY);
     if(saved)observations=validateMarketReviewBundle(JSON.parse(saved),byId) as Map<string,Observation>;
    }catch{
     actionStatus.textContent=pt
      ?"Registro local inválido ou indisponível; nenhuma observação foi carregada."
      :"Local records invalid or unavailable; no observations were loaded.";
    }
    render();
   }catch(e){
    stats.textContent=pt?"Falha ao carregar a fila de revisão.":"Failed to load review queue.";
    actionStatus.textContent=String(e);
   }
  }
  void start();
 }
</script>
<style is:global>
 .mpr-page{width:min(var(--content-width),94%);margin:0 auto;padding:26px 0 80px;color:var(--color-text)}
 .mpr-page h1{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.6rem);margin:12px 0}
 .mpr-page h2{font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--color-gold-light);margin:0 0 12px}
 .mpr-eyebrow{font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--color-accent)}
 .mpr-intro{max-width:970px;line-height:1.6}
 .mpr-disclaimer{padding:13px 17px;border-inline-start:3px solid var(--color-accent);background:var(--color-surface);font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}
 .mpr-panel{background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:7px;padding:clamp(12px,2vw,23px);margin:22px 0}
 .mpr-description{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.5}
 .mpr-toolbar,.mpr-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:end;margin:15px 0}
 .mpr-toolbar label{display:grid;gap:6px;flex:1 1 210px;min-width:180px;font-size:.92rem}
 .mpr-page :is(input,select,textarea){background:var(--color-background);color:var(--color-text);
  border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:5px;padding:9px;min-height:40px;font:inherit;width:100%}
 .mpr-page :is(input,select,textarea):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent)}
 .mpr-page button,.mpr-upload{display:inline-block;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius:5px;background:var(--color-background);color:var(--color-text);
  padding:8px 12px;min-height:39px;font:inherit;text-align:center}
 .mpr-page button:hover,.mpr-page button:focus-visible{border-color:var(--color-accent)}
 .mpr-table-wrap{max-width:100%;overflow:auto;max-height:660px;border:1px solid var(--color-border)}
 .mpr-page table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:640px;font-size:.92rem}
 .mpr-page th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2;background:var(--color-surface);
  border-bottom:2px solid var(--color-border);padding:11px 9px;text-align:left}
 .mpr-page td{padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);vertical-align:middle}
 .mpr-page tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:var(--color-background)}
 .mpr-page td:nth-child(4){text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 .mpr-page td:first-child{white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 .mpr-notes-label{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:12px}
 .mpr-upload{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
 .mpr-upload input[type=file]{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0;overflow:hidden}
 .mpr-page [hidden]{display:none!important}
 #mpr-action-status{min-height:1.3em;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
 @media(max-width:650px){.mpr-page{padding-top:16px}.mpr-toolbar label{flex-basis:100%}}
</style>
